-- mod-subclass: on mounts whose rider does not sit in the Mount pose (hover discs and carpets crouch in
-- StealthStand, choppers and cars recline, a few sit on the ground, hover or stand), the twin brother takes a seat
-- behind the rider with that same pose. mod_subclass_rider_pose names the seat for each such mount spell; it is
-- built from the client's mount spell visuals by tools/mkvehicles.py. Every other mount keeps seat 9531.

